(41, 296, '<h2 data-path-to-node=\"2\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Maiko Tokishima 3★</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Informations g&eacute;n&eacute;rales</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Titre :</strong> Apprentie Shinigami</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Arch&eacute;type :</strong> D&eacute;fenseur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">&Eacute;l&eacute;ment :</strong> Jaune</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tag# :</strong> &Eacute;l&egrave;ve de l\'Institut de formation | Institut de formation des Shinigamis</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Profil &amp; Stats</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Temps d\'attente du remplacement :</strong> 10</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hoh&ocirc; :</strong> 2 charges</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vitesse de d&eacute;placement :</strong> Normal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Passifs &amp; Capacit&eacute;s d\'&Acirc;me</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Type Ability (D&eacute;fenseur) :</strong> En entrant sur le terrain avec une mise &agrave; couvert, aucun temps d\'attente pour le perso remplac&eacute;. Lors d\'un duel, bonus de points de pioche de 50 obtenu.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inn&eacute; &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"7\">Aper&ccedil;u de scientifique (Niv. 1)</em> :</strong> En entrant sur le terrain avec une mise &agrave; couvert, d&eacute;g&acirc;ts inflig&eacute;s par toute l\'&eacute;quipe +5% et D&eacute;fense +5% (20 unit&eacute;s de temps).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">R&eacute;sistance :</strong> Dur&eacute;e d\'Entrave -30%.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">&Acirc;me 2 &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"8\">Temps d\'attente du remplacement &darr;</em> :</strong> R&eacute;duit de 3 unit&eacute;s le temps d\'attente des remplacements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">&Acirc;me 3 &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"8\">Attaque &uarr;</em> :</strong> Lors d\'une mise &agrave; couvert, Attaque +15% (20 unit&eacute;s de temps).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cartes Techniques</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Art 01 (Art devastateur - Physique) &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"38\">Encha&icirc;nement</em> :</strong> Attaque rapide continue.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Art 02 (Art surprise - Physique) &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">Attaque surprise</em> :</strong> Attaque en plongeant vers l\'avant.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sp&eacute;ciale (Physique) &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"22\">Coup de paume</em> :</strong> Inflige l\'alt&eacute;ration d\'&eacute;tat Engourdisssement 100%. Lib&egrave;re un puissant coup de paume...</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Comp&eacute;tence (Physique) &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"24\">&Eacute;clair de g&eacute;nie</em> :</strong> Adopte une posture de parade contre les projectiles. En cas de parade...</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '', '', '2026-07-29 02:26:27'),
