ts de pioche de 20 obtenu. Lors d\'une victoire en duel, bonus de 50 obtenu.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inn&eacute; &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"7\">L\'&acirc;me dans une seule frappe (Niv. 1)</em> :</strong> Lors d\'une victoire en duel, D&eacute;fense de l\'adversaire -15% (20 unit&eacute;s de temps).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">R&eacute;sistance :</strong> Dur&eacute;e d\'Entrave -30%.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"28,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">&Acirc;me 2 &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"28,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"8\">Renforce les chances de duel</em> :</strong> Chances de victoire en duel +5%.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"28,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">&Acirc;me 3 &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"28,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"8\">Attaque d\'&eacute;quipe &uarr;</em> :</strong> Lors d\'une victoire en duel, d&eacute;g&acirc;ts inflig&eacute;s par toute l\'&eacute;quipe +10% (20 unit&eacute;s de temps).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"29\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"29\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cartes Techniques</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"30\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"30,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Art 01 (Art devastateur - Physique) &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"30,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"38\">Encha&icirc;nement</em> :</strong> Attaque rapide continue.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"30,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Art 02 (Art devastateur - Physique) &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"30,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"38\">Coup puissant</em> :</strong> Attaque qui inflige un coup puissant.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"30,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sp&eacute;ciale (Physique) &mdash; <em data-path-to-node=\"30,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"22\">Full Swing</em> :</strong> Tranche l\'ennemi avec &laquo; Full Swing &raquo;.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"30,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Comp&eacute;tence :</strong> <em data-path-to-node=\"30,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"13\">Combativit&eacute; d&eacute;cha&icirc;n&eacute;e</em> &mdash; Chances de victoire en duel +30% (10 unit&eacute;s de temps).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '', '', '2026-07-29 02:25:40'),
